---
/* Planificador de video de evento. NO es un PDF descargable: son las decisiones
   que hay que tomar ANTES del evento, y al responderlas el cliente nos deja el
   brief entero más el email. Mismo mecanismo y mismos estilos que la calculadora
   de costos — .calc-wrap / .calc-q / .calc-chips ya están diseñados y andan con
   el dedo, así que no se inventa UI nueva.

   Estuvo con noindex desde que se hizo, sin entrar al sitemap ni al menú: 4 visitas y
   0 leads en toda su vida, porque nadie tenía cómo encontrarla. Aprobada el 26 ago
   2026 ("hacelo completo"), entra al índice y se enlaza desde Tools y desde los
   recursos de evento. */
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { localePath } from '../../../i18n.js';
const lang = "en";
const p = (s) => localePath(lang, s);
const title = {"en":"Event Video Planner — plan your event film | Viven"};
const description = {"en":"Eight questions that decide whether your event film works: how many pieces, video booth, live stream, audio and light. Get your brief by email."};
---
<Base lang={lang} slug="event-video-planner" active="" singleLang={true} langUrls={{"en": "/en/event-video-planner/"}} title={title} description={description}>

<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="post-wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">Free tool</span>
  <h1>Planning the video for your event?</h1>
  <p class="lead">The film is decided before the day, not on it. Eight questions — you get the answers as a brief you can send us or keep. Two minutes.</p>
</div></div></section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:24px"><div class="wrap"><div class="calc-wrap reveal">

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>1. How many pieces do you need?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="pieces">
      <button type="button" data-v="one">🎬 One recap film</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="cuts">✂️ Recap + short cuts</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="series">📚 A series</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="unsure">🤔 Not sure yet</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>2. How long do you want to keep posting from this event?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="window">
      <button type="button" data-v="days">A few days</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="weeks">A few weeks</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="months">Months — I want a content bank</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>3. The talks — whole or split?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="talks">
      <button type="button" data-v="full">One full recording</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="speaker">Split by speaker</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="both">Both</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="none">No talks to record</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>4. Should the audience take part?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="audience">
      <button type="button" data-v="qa">🙋 Q&amp;A from the floor</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="poll">📊 Live polls on screen</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="watch">Audience just watches</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>5. A video booth?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="booth">
      <button type="button" data-v="yes">🎤 Yes — collect testimonials</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="maybe">Tell me more</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="no">Not this time</button>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-tip" id="tip-booth" hidden>
      <b>The people who were there give the best testimonials</b> — and they give them on the day, while it is still fresh. A booth captures in one afternoon what takes weeks to chase afterwards.
      <br><br>
      It only works if it is planned: it needs its own corner, its own light, its own microphone and the questions written in advance. Thirty to sixty seconds per answer, three or four prompts to choose from, and the clip sent to each person the same day so they post it themselves.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>6. Live stream for those who can't come?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="stream">
      <button type="button" data-v="yes">📡 Yes</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="record">No — recording is enough</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="unsure">Not decided</button>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-tip" id="tip-stream" hidden>
      A live stream changes the crew, the connectivity and the budget. It is not a decision you can add the week before — the venue's internet has to be tested in advance.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>7. Audio — the one that decides everything</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="audio">
      <button type="button" data-v="desk">Take the venue's sound desk</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="own">Bring your own microphones</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="unsure">I don't know what the venue has</button>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-tip" id="tip-audio" hidden>
      A weak shot can be saved in the edit. Bad audio cannot. If nobody has confirmed what the venue's desk actually outputs, we plan for our own microphones and treat the desk feed as a backup.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-q"><h2>8. Light</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="light">
      <button type="button" data-v="venue">The venue lights the stage</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="own">We need to bring light</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="unsure">Not sure</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Pregunta 9. Se pregunta ACÁ y no en el email porque es el momento de más
       intención: acaba de tomar ocho decisiones sobre su evento. Y la respuesta viaja
       con el lead, así que aparece en el dashboard sin ninguna pieza nueva.
       (Sebastián, 26 ago 2026: "y le preguntamos, ¿necesitas una oferta?") -->
  <div class="calc-q"><h2>9. Do you want an offer for this?</h2>
    <div class="calc-chips" data-group="offer">
      <button type="button" data-v="yes">✅ Yes — send me an offer</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="budget">💰 I need a number for internal budget</button>
      <button type="button" data-v="later">Not yet — still planning</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-tip calc-tip-always">
    <b>One thing we will say before you ask for a price: use two cameras.</b> One person cannot cover the stage and the room's reaction at the same time, and what gets missed is gone — the event does not happen twice. The second camera costs little next to what it saves.
  </div>

  <div class="calc-form" id="ev-form-box">
    <h2>Get your brief</h2>
    <form id="ev-form" autocomplete="on">
      <input type="text" id="ev-name" placeholder="Name" required />
      <input type="email" id="ev-email" placeholder="Work email" required />
      <input type="text" id="ev-co" placeholder="Company (optional)" />
      <input type="text" id="ev-when" placeholder="Event date, if you have one" />
      <input type="text" id="ev-hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" style="position:absolute;left:-5000px" aria-hidden="true" />
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Email me my brief →</button>
    </form>
    <p class="form-note">We send the brief to your inbox so you can forward it to your team or another agency. We reply within one business day. No spam, ever.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-result" id="ev-result" hidden>
    <h2>Your event brief</h2>
    <ul id="ev-lines"></ul>
    <p class="form-note" id="ev-mail" style="margin-bottom:18px">📨 Sending it to your inbox…</p>
    <div class="ev-cta" id="ev-cta"></div>
    <p class="form-note" id="ev-sent"></p>
  </div>

</div></div></section>

<style>
  /* Las clases .calc-* no viven en site.css: cada calculadora las define en su
     propia página. Esta las define para sí misma y no depende de las otras. */
  .calc-wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:38px}
  .calc-q h2{font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 14px;font-weight:600}
  .calc-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
  .calc-chips button{appearance:none;font:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;cursor:pointer;
    padding:11px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background:var(--navy-800);color:var(--text);transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;
    min-height:44px}
  .calc-chips button:hover{border-color:var(--muted)}
  .calc-chips button.on{border-color:var(--acid);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--acid) 16%,transparent);color:var(--acid)}
  .calc-chips button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--acid);outline-offset:2px}
  .calc-form{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:30px}
  .calc-form h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:600}
  .calc-form form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;max-width:440px}
  .calc-form input{width:100%;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--text);font:inherit;font-size:16px}
  .calc-form input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--acid)}
  .calc-form button{margin-top:6px;align-self:flex-start}
  .calc-result{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:30px}
  .calc-result h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:600}
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .calc-wrap{gap:30px}
    .calc-q h2{font-size:17.5px}
    .calc-chips button{font-size:14.5px;padding:10px 14px}
  }
  .calc-tip{border-left:2px solid var(--acid);background:rgba(221,249,143,.07);padding:14px 16px;margin-top:12px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}
  .calc-tip b{color:var(--text)}
  .calc-tip-always{margin:26px 0 0}
  .calc-result ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 22px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
  /* :global() en los que el JS crea en runtime. Astro scopea agregando
     [data-astro-cid-…] a CADA parte del selector, y estos <li> nacen de un innerHTML —
     no llevan el atributo, así que la regla no les pegaba y el resumen que ve quien
     contestó las ocho preguntas salía sin estilos. El mismo bug que tenía el portal.
     El padre .calc-result SÍ está en el markup, así que el scope sigue acotado a esta
     página: las otras calculadoras definen sus propias .calc-* y no se pisan. */
  .calc-result :global(li){display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:9px}
  .calc-result :global(li span){color:var(--muted);flex:0 0 46%}
  .calc-result :global(li b){font-weight:600}
  .ev-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
</style>

<script is:inline>
(function(){
  var box = document.querySelector('.calc-wrap');
  if(!box) return;
  var pick = {};

  /* Los chips ya existen y andan con el dedo: solo hay que cablear la selección. */
  box.querySelectorAll('.calc-chips').forEach(function(g){
    g.addEventListener('click', function(e){
      var b = e.target.closest('button'); if(!b) return;
      g.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(x){ x.classList.remove('on'); });
      b.classList.add('on');
      pick[g.dataset.group] = { v: b.dataset.v, label: b.textContent.trim() };
      tips();
    });
  });

  /* Los consejos aparecen cuando son relevantes, no todos de entrada:
     un muro de advertencias no se lee. */
  function tips(){
    var m = {
      'tip-booth':  pick.booth  && (pick.booth.v === 'maybe' || pick.booth.v === 'yes'),
      'tip-stream': pick.stream && pick.stream.v === 'yes',
      'tip-audio':  pick.audio  && (pick.audio.v === 'unsure' || pick.audio.v === 'desk')
    };
    Object.keys(m).forEach(function(id){
      var el = document.getElementById(id); if(el) el.hidden = !m[id];
    });
  }

  var LABEL = {
    pieces:'Pieces needed', window:'Publishing window', talks:'Talks',
    audience:'Audience', booth:'Video booth', stream:'Live stream',
    audio:'Audio', light:'Light', offer:'Offer'
  };

  document.getElementById('ev-form').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
    e.preventDefault();
    var hp = document.getElementById('ev-hp');
    if(hp && hp.value) return;                    /* bot */
    var name  = document.getElementById('ev-name').value.trim();
    var email = document.getElementById('ev-email').value.trim();
    var co    = document.getElementById('ev-co').value.trim();
    var when  = document.getElementById('ev-when').value.trim();
    if(!name || !/^[^@\s]+@[^@\s]+\.[^@\s]+$/.test(email)) return;
    var btn = e.target.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
    btn.disabled = true;

    var lines = Object.keys(LABEL).filter(function(k){ return pick[k]; })
      .map(function(k){ return { k: LABEL[k], v: pick[k].label }; });
    if(when) lines.unshift({ k:'Event date', v: when });

    /* El resumen se muestra siempre, aunque el guardado falle: el que contestó
       ocho preguntas no se puede quedar sin nada. */
    var ul = document.getElementById('ev-lines');
    ul.innerHTML = lines.map(function(l){
      return '<li><span>' + l.k + '</span><b>' + l.v + '</b></li>';
    }).join('') || '<li>No answers selected.</li>';
    /* El cierre cambia según lo que contestó en la 9: al que ya pidió oferta no se le
       vuelve a ofrecer, se le dice qué sigue. */
    var esperaOferta = pick.offer && (pick.offer.v === 'yes' || pick.offer.v === 'budget');
    document.getElementById('ev-cta').innerHTML = esperaOferta
      ? '<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📅 Book 15 min and we go through it</a>'
      : '<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📅 Book a 15-min call</a>' +
        '<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/contact/">Actually, send me an offer →</a>';
    document.getElementById('ev-sent').textContent = esperaOferta
      ? 'We are on it — you get the offer within one business day.'
      : '';
    document.getElementById('ev-form-box').hidden = true;
    document.getElementById('ev-result').hidden = false;
    document.getElementById('ev-result').scrollIntoView({ behavior:'smooth', block:'start' });

    /* El email con el brief: es el punto de la herramienta. "La idea es que lo pueda
       usar para informar a su team también, o a otra agencia si es necesario."
       Reusa brief-email, que ya existe para /brief/: mismo diseño, mismo rate limit,
       y desde hoy también deja el email en la ficha de la persona. */
    var pares = lines.map(function(l){ return [l.k, l.v]; });
    if (window.SB_URL_PUB || true) {
      fetch('https://lumoevaotokgqnpybkyf.supabase.co/functions/v1/brief-email', {
        method:'POST',
        headers:{ 'Content-Type':'application/json', 'apikey':'sb_publishable_ORGL5_FNZTXcGKwvjs-ymw_Y8DV_4ca' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          to: email, name: name, lang: 'en', pairs: pares,
          extra: co ? 'Company: ' + co : '',
          page_uri: location.href, page_name: 'Event Video Planner',
          hutk: (window.vvHutk ? window.vvHutk() : null),
          gclid: (window.vvGclid ? window.vvGclid() : null)
        })
      }).then(function(r){ return r.json(); }).then(function(r){
        var n = document.getElementById('ev-mail');
        if (!n) return;
        n.textContent = (r && r.ok)
          ? '📨 Sent to ' + email + ' — forward it to whoever else needs it.'
          : 'We could not email it, but your brief is above — copy it from here.';
      }).catch(function(){});
    }

    var resumen = lines.map(function(l){ return l.k + ': ' + l.v; }).join('\n');
    var extra = window.vivenAttribution ? window.vivenAttribution() : null;
    var row = {
      name: name, first_name: name, email: email,
      company: co || '',
      message: 'EVENT VIDEO PLANNER\n\n' + resumen,
      form_path: location.pathname
    };
    if(extra){
      row.session_id = extra.session_id; row.lang = extra.lang;
      if(extra.attrib){ row.channel = extra.attrib.channel; row.utm_source = extra.attrib.utm_source; row.landing_path = extra.attrib.landing_path; }
    }
    if(window.hubspotSubmit) window.hubspotSubmit(name, '', email, resumen, co || '-');
    var nota = document.getElementById('ev-sent');
    if(window.sbInsertLead){
      window.sbInsertLead(row).then(function(r){
        nota.textContent = (r && r.ok)
          ? 'Saved — we have your brief. We will come back within one business day.'
          : 'Your brief is above. If you want us to quote it, use the button.';
      });
    }
    /* generate_lead: este formulario tampoco pasa por /thank-you/ */
    if(typeof window.gtag === 'function') window.gtag('event','generate_lead',{ method:'event_planner', page: location.pathname });
    try{ window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []; window.dataLayer.push({ event:'generate_lead', method:'event_planner', page: location.pathname }); }catch(_){}
  });
})();
</script>

</Base>
